    "updated_at": "2020-06-24T15:41:34Z",
    "body": "Many emoji have the unicode width of two characters, which may throw off how fish handles character deletion.\r\nWhat's curious is that this issue existed in Fish 2, where they introduced this configuration option. This was apparently fixed in Fish 3, and is not needed on my own system. Nonetheless, I'm glad it hear the fix worked for you 👍 ",
